{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"summary\": \"他从一开始就想同时拥有亲密中的回应、保有自我的空间和继续成长的可能，后来又发现，享受已经得到的满足也是一种需要，而这些愿望并不会自动协调。到了结尾，他不再强求所有愿望永远合拍，也学会珍惜已有的满足；但亲密、成长与享受所得之间的冲突仍未解决，未来能否继续兼顾也没有保证。\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"1\": \"C\",\n    \"2\": \"A\",\n    \"3\": \"B\",\n    \"4\": \"D\",\n    \"5\": \"A\",\n    \"6\": \"C\"\n  },\n  \"one_thing\": 7,\n  \"fill_in\": 4\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9d6b6ed4-d902-4706-a5ff-679b93e5d105", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261021T065954412250Z", "elapsed_seconds": 128.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T07:02:02.770230+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "61e071ad2cf54ff3ca7c1cfc0c24f17b282ff8d2bf325de521bae5114af83b24", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind":